<div class="stonetop-charintro">

  <header class="stonetop-charintro-hero">
    <h2>Welcome to <span class="stonetop-charintro-logo">Stonetop</span>!</h2>
  </header>

  <p class="stonetop-charintro-body">
    {{#if startedByGM}}Your GM has started a character for you: <strong>{{characterName}}</strong>.{{else}}Your character <strong>{{characterName}}</strong> is ready to be made.{{/if}} When you're ready, choose a playbook and walk through making your hero: pick a background, set your stats, choose your moves, and answer a few questions about who you are.
  </p>

  <p class="stonetop-charintro-body">
    There are no wrong answers. When you finish, or if you close the walkthrough part-way, your character sheet opens with everything you've chosen so far. Close this window instead and you'll be asked again the next time you log in.
  </p>

  <div class="stonetop-charintro-actions">
    <button type="button" class="stonetop-charintro-create">
      <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> Create Character
    </button>
  </div>

</div>
